cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dftfig in work you publish, please cite it."
title: "dftfig: an automated ORCA DFT and figure pipeline for molecular structures"
abstract: >-
  dftfig drives ORCA through geometry optimization, frequencies, a property
  single point and the N+-1 single points starting from structure files alone,
  then renders publication-ready figures of frontier orbitals, electrostatic
  potential, lipophilicity surfaces and physicochemical space. Every parameter
  is explained at the point of choice, and every number written to the figures
  is traceable to the calculation that produced it.
type: software
